  <reporting-org ref="NZ-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Zealand Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Trade</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023-2029 Fire and Emergency New Zealand (USAR) MOU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The head&#xa0;MOU with Fire and Emergency New Zealand&#xa0;(FENZ)&#xa0;outlines and agrees to work together on&#xa0;the following three areas:
1)&#xa0;The offshore deployment of assistance, including urban search and rescue (USAR), disaster assistance and response team (DART) to a disaster affected area in the&#xa0;Pacific, and elsewhere on a case by case basis;
2) Attendance at MFAT-led Post familiarisation visits to Pacific Island countries
3)&#xa0;Technical assistance for Pacific Emergency Services.</narrative>
  </description>
